<ModMetaData>
	<name>FCP - Combat Extended Patch</name>
	<author>Community patch</author>
	<packageId>AssassinsBro.fcp.combatextendedpatch</packageId>
	<supportedVersions>
		<li>1.6</li>
		<li>1.7</li>
	</supportedVersions>
	<description>Combat Extended compatibility for the Fallout Collaboration Project (FCP) mods.

Converts FCP weapons (ballistic, energy, explosive, melee), apparel/power armor and animals to Combat Extended. Phase 1 uses the ammo that ships with Combat Extended.

Load order: Harmony, Core, DLCs, Combat Extended, all FCP mods, then this mod.</description>
